'''Mystery boxes''' can be obtained from the [[Quiz Master]] [[random event]]. Players can choose between {{nocoins|1,000}} [[coins]] or the mystery box upon successfully completing the event. Multiple mystery boxes can be owned at once, and they can be banked. Five are received as a one-off reward from drinking a [[bottle of puzzlers poteen]].

It is recommended to wear a [[ring of wealth]] before opening the box, because of the significant chance to roll on the [[rare drop table]]. Doing this (along with completing all currently owned clue scrolls) will make it possible to completely eliminate the chance to receive nothing. If opened on [[Entrana]], the [[mithril scimitar]] drop is replaced by five [[mithril bar]]s, while the [[steel platebody]] drop is replaced by five [[steel bar]]s. This does not, however, occur while challenging [[Koschei the deathless]], and the box can be used to gain an extra advantage from its weapon and armour drops.

Because of the difference in the size of the drop tables between free-to-play and pay-to-play worlds, players looking for experience [[lamp]]s are better off opening their mystery boxes on free-to-play servers. Notably, the [[stale baguette]] is still obtainable on free-to-play worlds.

